flowchart LR
    A[User and item signals] --> B[Candidate generation]
    B --> C[Collaborative filtering / embeddings]
    B --> D[Content-based features]
    C --> E[Hundreds of candidates]
    D --> E
    E --> F[Ranking model: GBDT / DNN]
    F --> G[Re-rank: diversity, freshness, business rules]
    G --> H[Top-N recommendations]
    H --> I[Log clicks and conversions]
    I -->|feedback| A
    I --> J[Offline: NDCG, recall@k]
    I --> K[Online: CTR, retention A/B test]
